### Pediatric Brain Tumor {#pediatric-brain-tumor}









**1,731 of 2,792 patients** in the [pediatric brain tumor cohort](brain_tumor_cohort.qmd) have a Neural Frame registry case. Cases are linked by patient, so they are not necessarily brain tumor cases.

#### Registry case status

Each patient counts once per status and may appear in more than one row. Percentages use the full pediatric cohort, including patients without registry cases.




